# Vampire Survivors + Jev project

Before planning or changing anything, read `docs/CHARTER.md` (goal, philosophy, hard boundaries) and `docs/ROADMAP.md` (current phase, architecture, open questions, decision log). `AGENTS.md` at the repo root holds the hard rules and the loader lessons; follow it.

The owner is an experienced data engineer who is new to C#, Unity, IL2CPP, and game modding. Explain unfamiliar concepts in plain language before using them, and prefer small, verifiable changes.

If a change would contradict the charter, stop and ask the owner. When a roadmap plan changes, update the roadmap and add a decision-log entry.
